================================================================================
Reference clones
================================================================================

  The six clones inspected to produce the evidence above live under
  `.xia-src/` and are excluded from version control; each carries its own `.git`,
  so tracking them would create gitlinks nobody else can resolve. The entire tree
  is developer-local, including the analysis artifacts
  `.xia-src/EVIDENCE-PACKET.md` and `.xia-src/candidates/`; none of it is
  distributed with this repository. What this repository does retain is the
  provenance recorded above — each project's licence and the exact commit
  inspected. Source-file comments that cite a `.xia-src/` path cite it as the
  origin of the code they describe, not as a file a reader can open here.
